              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enk 7.6-24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kedaai apa, neokishoi, neyamishoi, neishoori meyami, o meeu ina olong natijing'a Noa atua emeli, nelotu oloirrag le nkare nemut ninche pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.27",
